ters.&nbsp; Perfect for printing color brochures, flyers, newsletters and other business and sales materials, HP Professional Brochure &amp; Flyer Papers are the easy and affordable way to produce colorful and professional-quality materials at your desktop. Strategic Planning Subcommittee Meeting Rescheduled April 12th Meeting Moved to May 4 For best results when printing, choose HP Premium Inkjet Paper, Special Paper or HP Brochure &amp; Flyer Paper as the paper type on your HP color inkjet printer. PITA Board to Meet April 7 ember Profiles Should be Completed Not Later than April 3 KMT Software is the leading developer of templates for Microsoft Office.&nbsp; Visit our web site at www.kmt.com to learn about our Office template collections.&nbsp; Use one of our hundreds of templates to get your job done quickly and professionally.&nbsp; Contact us at info@kmt.com if you have questions or product ideas. &nbsp; ");
